do MouseManager.set_mouse_mode_visible()
In this game you must cross a bridge
The bridge is composed of 6 segments. You must decide if you want to step onto a segment or jump acorss it to land on the next segment.
It truly is not for the faint of heart
Now vote for a bridge to remove your segment from
- Bridge 1
	set {GameplayRound1Tracker.bridge_1_segment_6_rigged} = true
- Bridge 2
	set {GameplayRound1Tracker.bridge_2_segment_6_rigged} = true
- Bridge 3
	set {GameplayRound1Tracker.bridge_3_segment_6_rigged} = true
- Bridge 4
	set {GameplayRound1Tracker.bridge_4_segment_6_rigged} = true
- Bridge 5
	set {GameplayRound1Tracker.bridge_5_segment_6_rigged} = true
- Bridge 6
	set {GameplayRound1Tracker.bridge_6_segment_6_rigged} = true
I hope you don't regret your choice
do MouseManager.set_mouse_mode_captured()
jump gameplay_artsy_round_1/